## 4. Corrected numbers (RealTalk, 705 queries / 8944 docs)

Narrow doc-side truth (exact): k=96: 115,008 total = 12.86/doc (13.72 with mu). k=192: 230,016 = 25.72 (27.43). k=384: 460,032 = 51.43 (54.87).

Deployed lower bound (f32 matrices + f64 idf + term bytes + mu/sigma + packed): k=96 ~14,120/doc (range 7,223 RT06 to 34,418 RT05). k=192 ~26,475. k=384 ~51,186. f64 doubles matrices (~28 KB/doc at k=96).

Rivals from actual corpora (exact): coarse BM25 index 670,511 (74.97/doc), +text 1,669,165 (186.62/doc). Fair frozen BM25: 519,740 (58.11/doc). Accuracy: qscale 49.65/55.32/57.87 vs fair BM25 65.67 (-16.03/-10.35/-7.80).

Ratios: published 5.83x -> 4.52x vs compared rival (4.24x with mu) -> ~1/188 symmetric deployed (~1/243 vs fair; ~1/76 vs index+text).

